1200 BM$="Voice: David...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 BM$="David: Who are you?! Show yourself!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 BM$="Hroth: I am King Hroth. I swore upon the star of darkness that I would\return as the Devil King. Now that the star of darkness approaches the\Earth, my blood begs for my resurrection.":GOSUB 5100
1230 BM$="The voice sounded so clear that David looked around the room once again.\No one but him and Susanna were there.":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="Hroth: David. By laying your eyes on the blood of the northern tribes, my\blood, flowing within your veins, shall awaken, and the power of the Devil\King will be manifest.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="You must use that power to sever the blood of the King of the North.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 BM$="David: Are you saying I'm a descendant of the Devil King...? Well, I refuse. I\don't NEED the power of the Devil King. I'm fine the way I am!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 BM$="Hroth: That... will not do. The King of the North will hunt you down and kill\you in order to sever the bloodline of the Devil King. You cannot withdraw,\for the fated battle has already begun.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 BM$="David: So you're behind the nightmares, the visions I've been having? I'm\not going to become a murderer for the sake of a grudge from a time long\past!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 BM$="Hroth: The power of the Devil King is already manifesting itself in you, due\to the influence of the star of darkness. You have no other choice, David!\You MUST follow your destiny!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1290 BM$="David: What do you mean, the power is manifesting in me? You're insane! I\know nothing about this Devil King business! NOTHING!!":GOSUB 5100
