1500 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: David, what's wrong?! Who are you talking to?!":GOSUB 5100
1510 BM$="Her voice brought him back to his senses. He could no longer hear the\voice of King Hroth.":GOSUB 5100
1520 BM$="Susanna: You're sweating like crazy! Did you have a nightmare?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1530 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: It was neither a nightmare nor a vision. It was King Hroth - I heard\his voice. He told me that I've inherited the blood of the Devil King, and\that I'm manifesting his power because the star of darkness is near.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1540 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: King Hroth, you say? I didn't hear anyone... And he said you're one\of his descendants?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1550 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: He said that I must lay my eyes on the blood of the northern tribes,\awaken as the Devil King, and sever the blood of the King of the North... I\don't know who that is, but he must be a man. I'm not a murderer.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1560 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: The star of darkness... That's the star upon which King Hroth\swore to return as the Devil King. Did he say anything about where to find\the King of the North?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1570 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: No, nothing about it. He only said that, because I've already\manifested the power of the Devil King, the northern tribes will come to\kill me. Maybe we should cancel our trip...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1580 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Why? Do you think it might actually be true?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1590 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: There's something I haven't told you... The reason I woke up early\this morning was to meet someone... to talk about the Devil King.":GOSUB 5100
1600 BM$="David told her about the letter he received and his meeting with Connors.\He took care not to mention his accusations regarding Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
1610 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: His story sounded like a load of crap at first, but only the two of us\should know about the Devil King, or the star of darkness. How's that\possible?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: We don't know who this mystery person Connors talked to is,\other than he's someone important... What would they have to gain from\tricking you? Could he be the King of the North...?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1630 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: The King of the North... Yeah, he would know about the Devil King and\the star of darkness...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1640 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I want to see him in person. If he does work for that weekly\magazine, he might have an impact on our future concerts. I'd like to know\who we're dealing with.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1650 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Damn it! Just when I thought I was free from my nightmares, now I'm\haunted by the ghost of King Hroth! Some vacation this is gonna be!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1660 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I used to think they were just nightmares, but after what King\Hroth told you I'm starting to think they might be premonitions. I'm going\to look into this King of the North.":GOSUB 5100
